    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Eysan your adorable and interactive desktop companion. Whether you're studying, working, gaming, or watching videos, Eysan stays by your side, bringing life to your screen. With features like notetaking, reminders, a timer, and the Pomodoro technique, Eysan transforms your desktop into a more fun, productive, and less lonely place. Designed to improve your daily routine and motivation, Eysan is more than just a character it\u2019s your personal productivity partner.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Eysan your adorable and interactive desktop companion. Whether you're studying, working, gaming, or watching videos, Eysan stays by your side, bringing life to your screen. With features like notetaking, reminders, a timer, and the Pomodoro technique, Eysan transforms your desktop into a more fun, productive, and less lonely place. Designed to improve your daily routine and motivation, Eysan is more than just a character it\u2019s your personal productivity partner.</p>",
